Longlegs premiered in Los Angeles at the Grauman''s Egyptian Theatre on July 8, 2024, and was released theatrically in the United States by Neon on July 12, 2024. It received positive reviews and grossed $128 million worldwide on a budget of less than $10 million, becoming Neon''s highest-grossing film domestically, the highest-grossing independent film of 2024, and Perkins''s highest-grossing film.','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Longlegs','{}',0,0,0,0,'{}',CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000,CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000) ON CONFLICT(imdb_id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,release_year=excluded.release_year,genre=excluded.genre,poster_key=excluded.poster_key,source_url=excluded.source_url,poster_source_url=CASE WHEN excluded.poster_source_url<>'' THEN excluded.poster_source_url ELSE pix_movie_stats.poster_source_url END,synopsis=CASE WHEN excluded.synopsis<>'' THEN excluded.synopsis ELSE pix_movie_stats.synopsis END,synopsis_source_url=CASE WHEN excluded.synopsis_source_url<>'' THEN excluded.synopsis_source_url ELSE pix_movie_stats.synopsis_source_url END,updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
