Originally an adaptation of Dracula''s Daughter (1936), the film was announced to be in development in April 2023, with Bettinelli-Olpin and Gillett attached as directors, and Shields and Busick hired to write the screenplay. It was also announced that the film would be a co-production between Bettinelli-Olpin, Gillett, and Chad Villella''s Radio Silence Productions, James Vanderbilt, Paul Neinstein, and William Sherak''s Project X Entertainment, and Tripp Vinson''s Vinson Films.
Abigail had its world premiere at the Overlook Film Festival on April 7, 2024, and was theatrically released in the United States by Universal Pictures on April 19. The film received generally positive reviews from critics and grossed $43 million on a $28 million production budget.','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abigail_(2024_film)','{}',0,0,0,0,'{}',CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000,CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000) ON CONFLICT(imdb_id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,release_year=excluded.release_year,genre=excluded.genre,poster_key=excluded.poster_key,source_url=excluded.source_url,poster_source_url=CASE WHEN excluded.poster_source_url<>'' THEN excluded.poster_source_url ELSE pix_movie_stats.poster_source_url END,synopsis=CASE WHEN excluded.synopsis<>'' THEN excluded.synopsis ELSE pix_movie_stats.synopsis END,synopsis_source_url=CASE WHEN excluded.synopsis_source_url<>'' THEN excluded.synopsis_source_url ELSE pix_movie_stats.synopsis_source_url END,updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
