Seinfeld''s feature directorial debut, he and Feresten also serve as producers of the film alongside Beau Bauman, through their production company Columbus 81 Productions. Unfrosted was released in the United States by Netflix on May 3, 2024, and received mixed reviews from critics. It was nominated for a Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Television Movie, while Seinfeld won Worst Actor and Schumer won Worst Supporting Actress at the 45th Golden Raspberry Awards.','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unfrosted','{}',0,0,0,0,'{}',CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000,CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000) ON CONFLICT(imdb_id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,release_year=excluded.release_year,genre=excluded.genre,poster_key=excluded.poster_key,source_url=excluded.source_url,poster_source_url=CASE WHEN excluded.poster_source_url<>'' THEN excluded.poster_source_url ELSE pix_movie_stats.poster_source_url END,synopsis=CASE WHEN excluded.synopsis<>'' THEN excluded.synopsis ELSE pix_movie_stats.synopsis END,synopsis_source_url=CASE WHEN excluded.synopsis_source_url<>'' THEN excluded.synopsis_source_url ELSE pix_movie_stats.synopsis_source_url END,updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
