The film had its world premiere at the Sundance Film Festival on January 21, 2024, and was screened at the 74th Berlin International Film Festival on February 16, where Stan won the Silver Bear for Best Leading Performance. It was theatrically released in the United States on September 20, 2024, by A24. It received positive reviews from critics, who mostly praised the performances of Stan and Pearson, as well as Schimberg''s screenplay. The film earned a nomination for Best Makeup and Hairstyling at the 97th Academy Awards, while Stan won Best Actor in a Motion Picture – Musical or Comedy at the 82nd Golden Globe Awards.','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Different_Man','{}',0,0,0,0,'{}',CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000,CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000) ON CONFLICT(imdb_id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title,release_year=excluded.release_year,genre=excluded.genre,poster_key=excluded.poster_key,source_url=excluded.source_url,poster_source_url=CASE WHEN excluded.poster_source_url<>'' THEN excluded.poster_source_url ELSE pix_movie_stats.poster_source_url END,synopsis=CASE WHEN excluded.synopsis<>'' THEN excluded.synopsis ELSE pix_movie_stats.synopsis END,synopsis_source_url=CASE WHEN excluded.synopsis_source_url<>'' THEN excluded.synopsis_source_url ELSE pix_movie_stats.synopsis_source_url END,updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
